### 좋아요 추가
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/likes
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser1
X-Loopers-LoginPw: password123!

{
  "productId": 1
}

### 좋아요 취소 (path variable = productId)
DELETE {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/likes/1
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser1
X-Loopers-LoginPw: password123!

### 내가 좋아요한 상품 목록
GET {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/likes/me?page=0&size=20
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser1
X-Loopers-LoginPw: password123!
